//
// # Transport
//
// cua-spacesd serves every service in this package on one port (default
// 3211) as native gRPC (HTTP/2) and gRPC-Web (HTTP/1.1) side by side. gRPC-Web
// cannot carry client-streaming or bidirectional RPCs, so every client-stream
// RPC in this package has a unary, chunked fallback that is functionally
// equivalent. The SDK picks the fallback automatically on gRPC-Web transports.
//
// # Authentication
//
