// contract) requires the `authorization: Bearer <token>` metadata entry once
// a token is configured. A token is mandatory for any non-loopback bind.
// Media and tunnel sockets do not use the root token: they authenticate with
// short-lived tickets minted by `StreamService.OpenMedia`,
// `TunnelService.Forward` and `TunnelService.StartHotspot`.
//
